{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はブログ書くこと無いから\n答えちゃうお多めです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/09/23/4592619/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛口が美味しくないわけじゃないけど\n甘口のが風味わかるから好き！\nでも甘口よりグリーンカレーみたいに\n甘くて後からめっちゃ辛い\nみたいなの好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/09/23/4592619/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モバメのね！\nそうだよ～！当たり＼^^／\nおいしかった(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/09/23/4592619/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そもそも上履きとかなかったし\n常にローファーの学校だったから\n全然、外履きで大丈夫なんだよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/09/23/4592619/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"別の友達だよ～(・∀・)\nレシートの子会えてない(;_;)\n会いたい(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/09/23/4592619/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高2で転校したけど\n中高一貫だから\n実はいるんです(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はお茶会とカルタ大会\nカルタは初めてだけど\nお茶会は今まで楽しかったから\n今回も楽しみだな(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれるかた\n待ってるね＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/09/23/4592619/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな意味で1000年に一人の逸材だと\n中田が豪語する\n琴子と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}